{
  "title": "Credit Billing",
  "uid": "credit-billing",
  "description": "Credit wallets, usage export and the reconciliation of the usage records (specs/010-credit-billing-readiness; app/billing/*, app/core/metrics.py, pushed via OTel/OTLP through the otel-collector). No Postgres datasource is provisioned, so everything here is a metric; per-tenant detail is `make credits` and `make credit-reconcile`.",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "tags": [
    "agent-core-demo",
    "billing"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Wallets: balance, grants and debits",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Credits outstanding (usable)",
      "description": "Credits that may still be consumed across every wallet, set by each reconciliation pass (app/billing/reconcile.py), so it is as fresh as the last pass and absent when `make credit-reconcile-worker` is not running. Who holds what: `make credits ARGS='show --tenant ...'`.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(agent_credit_outstanding{state=\"available\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Credits owed (overdraft)",
      "description": "Credits tenants have used beyond what they held: booked as debt on overdraft lots and repaid first by the next grant. Above zero is normal for a postpaid tenant and a missed top-up for a prepaid one.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(agent_credit_outstanding{state=\"debt\"})",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1e-06
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Credits granted per hour, by source",
      "description": "agent_credit_granted_total: credits added to wallets, counted when the grant is applied (a transaction that later rolls back is over-counted: a rate, not the record).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (source) (rate(agent_credit_granted_total[$__rate_interval])) * 3600",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Credits debited per hour, by kind",
      "description": "agent_credit_debited_total: debit = model calls, clawback = refunds, adjust = operator corrections. Expiry is not here: those credits left unused.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(agent_credit_debited_total[$__rate_interval])) * 3600",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Overdraft debits and refused turns",
      "description": "Debits larger than the wallet held, and turns refused before any model work for want of credits (a rate to watch, not an alert).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(agent_credit_overdraft_total[$__rate_interval])) * 3600",
          "legendFormat": "overdraft debits / h",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(agent_credit_enforcement_refused_total[$__rate_interval])) * 3600",
          "legendFormat": "refused turns / h",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Money out: usage export",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Export lag: age of the oldest unsent event",
      "description": "agent_usage_export_oldest_pending_age_seconds, per provider, set each worker pass (0 when nothing waits). UsageExportStuck fires at 7 days. If the worker stops the series disappears within five minutes rather than growing.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (provider) (agent_usage_export_oldest_pending_age_seconds)",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Export outcomes per hour",
      "description": "agent_usage_export_total: sent includes a provider-reported duplicate; retry backs off; failed and expired are alerted.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (provider, outcome) (rate(agent_usage_export_total[$__rate_interval])) * 3600",
          "legendFormat": "{{provider}} {{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Money in and the independent check",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Payment webhooks per hour, by outcome",
      "description": "agent_billing_webhook_total: quarantined means a customer paid and was granted nothing (alert BillingWebhookQuarantined).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(agent_billing_webhook_total[$__rate_interval])) * 3600",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Largest drift above tolerance (USD)",
      "description": "agent_credit_reconcile_max_drift_usd: the largest tenant-day difference between usage events and the ledger, the gateway spend log or the wallet, from the last pass; 0 when they agree. `make credit-reconcile` names the tenant, day and amount.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(agent_credit_reconcile_max_drift_usd)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1e-06
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 27
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Reconciliation passes by outcome",
      "description": "agent_credit_reconcile_total: ok | drift | incomplete (the gateway read was not whole, so it was not compared) | failed (the pass raised). failed and incomplete alert (CreditReconcileNotCompleting).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (increase(agent_credit_reconcile_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            },
            "spanNulls": true
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": []
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 27
      }
    }
  ]
}
